{"verse_key": "13:13", "surah": 13, "verse": 13, "text_uthmani": "وَيُسَبِّحُ ٱلرَّعْدُ بِحَمْدِهِۦ وَٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ مِنْ خِيفَتِهِۦ وَيُرْسِلُ ٱلصَّوَٰعِقَ فَيُصِيبُ بِهَا مَن يَشَآءُ وَهُمْ يُجَـٰدِلُونَ فِى ٱللَّهِ وَهُوَ شَدِيدُ ٱلْمِحَالِ", "translation": "And the thunder exalts [Allāh] with praise of Him - and the angels [as well] from fear of Him - and He sends thunderbolts and strikes therewith whom He wills while they dispute about Allāh; and He is severe in assault.", "verse_from_ms": 306900, "verse_to_ms": 337460, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/13.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "وَيُسَبِّحُ", "start_ms": 306900, "end_ms": 308410}, {"i": 1, "text": "ٱلرَّعْدُ", "start_ms": 308410, "end_ms": 309150}, {"i": 2, "text": "بِحَمْدِهِۦ", "start_ms": 309150, "end_ms": 310350}, {"i": 3, "text": "وَٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ", "start_ms": 310350, "end_ms": 313120}, {"i": 4, "text": "مِنْ", "start_ms": 313120, "end_ms": 313430}, {"i": 5, "text": "خِيفَتِهِۦ", "start_ms": 313430, "end_ms": 314640}, {"i": 6, "text": "وَيُرْسِلُ", "start_ms": 314640, "end_ms": 315700}, {"i": 7, "text": "ٱلصَّوَٰعِقَ", "start_ms": 315700, "end_ms": 316890}, {"i": 8, "text": "فَيُصِيبُ", "start_ms": 316890, "end_ms": 317920}, {"i": 9, "text": "بِهَا", "start_ms": 317920, "end_ms": 318500}, {"i": 10, "text": "مَن", "start_ms": 318500, "end_ms": 321760}, {"i": 11, "text": "يَشَآءُ", "start_ms": 321760, "end_ms": 323510}, {"i": 12, "text": "وَهُمْ", "start_ms": 323510, "end_ms": 324720}, {"i": 13, "text": "يُجَـٰدِلُونَ", "start_ms": 324720, "end_ms": 325740}, {"i": 14, "text": "فِى", "start_ms": 325740, "end_ms": 326330}, {"i": 15, "text": "ٱللَّهِ", "start_ms": 326330, "end_ms": 327120}, {"i": 16, "text": "وَهُوَ", "start_ms": 327120, "end_ms": 329970}, {"i": 17, "text": "شَدِيدُ", "start_ms": 329970, "end_ms": 330490}, {"i": 18, "text": "ٱلْمِحَالِ", "start_ms": 330490, "end_ms": 331920}]}